        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaakoba Abaisiraeli ati: “Mutenga inho omwoyo ku biragiro byonabyona bye mbaghaire olwaleero, mubituukirizenga bukalamu. Olwo musobole okwala, mutwale ensi Musengwa Katonda ye yasuubiza okugha badhaadha baimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era muteerabiranga nga Musengwa Katonda waimwe bweyabakulemberamu mu lugendo lwonalwona, emyaka gino amakumi ana mu irungu, ng'agendereramu okubafuula abawulize. Era yaabaleba, asobole okumanha ekiri mu myoyo gyaimwe, abone oba nga munaakuumanga ebiragiro bye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabaleka endhala yaabaluma, aye yaamala yaabagha mannu mwalya, emere ye mwali nga timulyangaku waire badhaadha baimwe. Ekyo yakikola okubeegeresa nti omuntu taba mulamu na mere yonka, aye aba mulamu lwa buli kibono Musengwa Katonda mwene ky'ayogera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
